decision_conditions:
Condition : 1 - 1.	The development shall be carried out in accordance with the  previously approved details of reserved matters and conditions that relate to the planning permissions listed below, for: 

(i)	design, siting and height of the buildings;
(ii)	means of access and circulation for pedestrians, cyclists and people with disabilities;
(iii)	the external appearance of the buildings and the materials to be used on all external surfaces including colours and textures;
(iv)	means of access, parking and service roads including road widths, sight lines, and space for loading, off-loading and manoeuvring and turning of vehicles; and
(v)	refuse storage accommodation and access thereto

00248/D/P44(A)(B)(C), 00248/D5(P2), 00248/D/P46, 00248/D4/P1, 00248/D/P53,  00248/D/P54, 00248/D/P56, and 00248/D/P7(a).
